@startuml

title Data Flow Diagram - Knowledge Testing System
legend top
Level 0 (Context Diagram) - Gane-Sarson Notation
Shows main processes and external entities
end legend

' External entities
rectangle "Telegram User" as User
rectangle "Administrator" as Admin
rectangle "Telegram API" as TgApi

' Processes
rectangle "1 Manage Users" as P1
rectangle "2 Manage Tests" as P2
rectangle "3 Conduct Test" as P3
rectangle "4 Calculate Results" as P4

' Data stores
database "User Data Store" as DS1
database "Test Library" as DS2
database "Results Archive" as DS3
database "Session Cache" as DS4

' Data flows
User --> P1 : Login Request\nuser_credentials
P1 --> DS1 : User Validated\nread/write
DS1 --> P1 : User Profile
P1 --> User : Session Token

User --> P2 : View Tests\ntest_request
P2 --> DS2 : Available Tests\nread
DS2 --> P2 : Test List
P2 --> User : Test List

User --> P3 : Start Test\ntest_selection
DS2 --> P3 : Question Data\nread
P3 --> User : Questions
User --> P3 : Answers\nuser_answers
P3 --> DS3 : Attempt Record\nwrite

P3 --> P4 : Answers for Analysis\nanswers
DS2 --> P4 : Answer Key\nread
P4 --> DS3 : Score Calculation\nwrite
P4 --> User : Result Notification\nresult_data

Admin --> P2 : Create Test\ntest_creation
P2 --> DS2 : Store Test\nwrite

Admin --> P4 : View Analytics\nanalytics_request
DS3 --> P4 : Result Data\nread
P4 --> Admin : Statistics\nanalytics_report

TgApi --> P1 : Message Events\nwebhook
P1 --> TgApi : Send Message\nsendMessage
P3 --> TgApi : Send Question\nsendMessage
P4 --> TgApi : Send Result\nsendMessage

note bottom of P1
Handles user authentication
and session management
end note

note bottom of P2
Manages test creation,
updating and retrieval
end note

note bottom of P3
Handles test execution
and answer collection
end note

note bottom of P4
Processes answers,
calculates scores,
generates reports
end note

@enduml

